ckness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;line-height:12.65pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Cambria, serif;color:#000000;\">Iconic Imprint has no obligation to use any UGC.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 10pt;font-size:medium;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;line-height:12.65pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Cambria, serif;color:#000000;\">8. Term &amp; Termination</span></p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 10pt;font-size:medium;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;line-height:12.65pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Cambria, serif;color:#000000;\">Either party may terminate participation in the Program at any time, with or without cause. Upon termination:</span></p><p style=\"margin-right:0in;margin-left:0in;font-size:medium;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;\"><span style=\"font-family:'-webkit-standard', serif;color:#000000;\">a) Affiliate must immediately cease use of all Affiliate Tools and Iconic Imprint brand assets</span></p><p style=\"margin-right:0in;margin-left:0in;font-size:medium;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;\"><span style=\"font-family:'-webkit-standard', serif;color:#000000;\">b) Any unpaid commissions may be forfeited if termination results from a breach of these Terms</span></p><p style=\"margin-right:0in;margin-left:0in;font-size:medium;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;\"><span style=\"font-family:'-webkit-standard', serif;color:#000000;\">c) Sections intended to survive termination shall remain in effect</span></p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 10pt;font-size:medium;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;line-height:12.65pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Cambria, serif;color:#000000;\">9. Independent Contractor Status</span></p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 10pt;font-size:medium;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;line-height:12.65pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Cambria, serif;color:#000000;\">Affiliate is an independent contractor and is not an employee, partner, agent, or representative of Iconic Imprint. Affiliate has no authority to bind Iconic Imprint.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 10pt;font-size:medium;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decora