uto;text-decoration-style:solid;line-height:12.65pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Cambria, serif;color:#000000;\">Any dispute, claim, or controversy arising out of or relating to these Terms, the Program, or the relationship between Affiliate and Iconic Imprint (collectively, “Disputes”) shall be resolved exclusively through final and binding arbitration, rather than in court, except that either party may bring an individual action in small claims court if the claim qualifies.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 10pt;font-size:medium;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;line-height:12.65pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Cambria, serif;color:#000000;\">Arbitration shall be conducted on an individual basis in accordance with the rules of the American Arbitration Association (AAA) then in effect. The arbitration shall be held in the State of Texas, County of Travis, unless the parties mutually agree otherwise. The arbitrator shall have exclusive authority to resolve any dispute relating to the interpretation, applicability, enforceability, or formation of this arbitration agreement.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 10pt;font-size:medium;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;line-height:12.65pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Cambria, serif;color:#000000;\">YOU AND ICONIC IMPRINT HEREBY WAIVE ANY RIGHT TO A JURY TRIAL for all Disputes to the fullest extent permitted by law.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 10pt;font-size:medium;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;line-height:12.65pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Cambria, serif;color:#000000;\">All Disputes shall be brought solely on an individual basis. Affiliate agrees that they may not bring, join, or participate in any class action, collective action, representative action, or private attorney general action against Iconic Imprint.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 10pt;font-size:medium;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;line-height:12.65pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Cambria, serif;color:#000000;\">The arbitrator shall not have authority to consolidate claims or award relief on a class, collective, or representative basis.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 10pt;font-size:medium;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;line-height:12.65pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Cambria, serif;color:#000000;\">Each party shall bear its own attorneys’ fees and costs unless otherwise required by law or awarded by the arbitrator. Arbitration filing and administrative fees shall be allocated in accordance with AAA rules.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 10pt;font-size:medium;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;line-height:12.65pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Cambria, serif;color:#000000;\">Notwithstanding the foregoing, Iconic Imprint may seek injunctive or equitable relief in a court of competent jurisdiction to prevent or remedy misuse of intellectual property, fraud, or unauthorized use of brand assets.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 10pt;font-size:medium;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;line-height:12.65pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Cambria, serif;color:#000000;\">If any portion of this Section is found to be unenforceable, the remaining portions shall remain in full force and effect. If the class action waiver is found unenforceable, the arbitration requirement shall be null and void solely as to that claim.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 10pt;font-size:medium;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration-line:none;text-decoration-thickness:auto;text-decoration-style:solid;line-height:12.65pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Cambria, serif;color:#000000;\">Affiliate may opt out of this arbitration agreement by providing written notice to Iconic Imprint within thirty (30) days of accepting these Terms. The notice must include Affiliate’s full name and a clear statement of intent to opt out. Opting out does not affect any other provisions of these Terms.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 10pt;font-size:medium;font-family:'Times New Roman', serif;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;